  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 502.03 Late Renewal and Reinstatement Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 502.03 Late Renewal and Reinstatement Fees. Late renewal and reinstatement fees for the licensure of mechanical business entities shall be as follows:\n\n(a) For late renewal past 30 days and up to 12 months: $25.00 per month; and\n\n(b) For licensing reinstatement of mechanical business entity licenses that have been expired longer than 12 months, or are reinstated following suspension or revocation: $550.00.\n\nSource. #10849, eff 7-1-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec500.html"
